Algorithm 3 Complete watermarking algorithm $\mathsf{Wat}_{\mathsf{\vphantom{p}sk}}$

Data: A prompt (prompt) and a secret key $\mathsf{\vphantom{p}sk}$
Result: Watermarked text $x_{1},\ldots,x_{L}$
1 $i\leftarrow 1$;
2 $H\leftarrow 0$;
3 while $\texttt{done}\notin(x_{1},\ldots,x_{i-1})$ do
4 $p_{i}\leftarrow\mathsf{Model}(\textsc{prompt},x_{1},\ldots,x_{i-1})$;
5 if $H<\lambda$ then
// Collect more internal entropy
6 Sample $x_{i}\leftarrow p_{i}$;
7 $H\leftarrow H-\log p_{i}(x_{i})$;
8 if $H\geq\lambda$ then
9 $r\leftarrow(x_{1},\dots,x_{i})$;
10 end if
11 else
// Embed the watermark
12 $x_{i}\leftarrow\mathbbm{1}[F_{\mathsf{\vphantom{p}sk}}(r,i)\leq p_{i}(1)]$;
13 end if
14 $i\leftarrow i+1$;
15 end while

