Algorithm 5 Substring-complete watermarking algorithm $\mathsf{Wat}_{\mathsf{\vphantom{p}sk}}$.

Data: A prompt (prompt), secret key $\mathsf{\vphantom{p}sk}$, and parameter $\lambda$
Result: Watermarked text $x_{1},\ldots,x_{L}$
1 $r\leftarrow\bot,H\leftarrow 0,i\leftarrow 1,\ell\leftarrow 0$;
2 while $\texttt{done}\notin(x_{1},\ldots,x_{i-1})$ do
3 $p_{i}\leftarrow\mathsf{Model}(\textsc{prompt},x_{1},\ldots,x_{i-1})$;
4 if $r=\bot$ then
// Still sampling the first block
5 Sample $x_{i}\leftarrow p_{i}$;
6 else
// Embed the watermark
7 $x_{i}\leftarrow\mathbbm{1}[F_{\mathsf{\vphantom{p}sk}}(r,i)\leq p_{i}(1)]$;
8 $H\leftarrow H-\log p_{i}(x_{i})$;
9 if $H\geq\frac{2}{\ln 2}\lambda\sqrt{\ell}$ then
// Reassign $r$
10 $r\leftarrow(x_{i-\ell},\dots,x_{i})$;
11 $H\leftarrow 0,\ell\leftarrow 0$;
12 end if
13 $i\leftarrow i+1,\ell\leftarrow\ell+1$;
14 end while

